because.Rather, therefore, as the particle {kee} also signifies (see
Ps 116:10:)  so Noldius, {Ideo voluit Jehova eos interficere,}
"Therefore Jehovah purposed to destroy them."

for there is no restraint.Where there is a promise of defense and support, the weakest,
in the face of the strongest enemy, may rely upon it with the
utmost confidence.

But Saul.Rather, "For Saul," etc., as the particle [Vâv,] {wav,}
frequently signifies; this being the cause why David took
another wife.
